      "title": "Two helicopters collide outside Athens as Greece battles to control wildfires",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/02/western-europe-wildfire-crisis-retreats-greece-evacuates-hundreds-athens",
      "description": "<p>Fire department says two-person crew of one aircraft killed in incident during gale-force winds to west of capital</p><p>Two firefighting helicopters have collided west of Athens, killing the two-person crew of one of the aircraft, as efforts to control a massive wildfire barrelling towards the outskirts of the Greek capital intensified.</p><p>Footage showed one of the helicopters losing control in the face of gale-force winds that have pushed flames towards settlements on Athens’ western fringes.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/02/western-europe-wildfire-crisis-retreats-greece-evacuates-hundreds-athens\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-08-02T17:36:18"
    },
    {
      "title": "2 Killed as Firefighting Helicopters Collide in Greece",
      "link": "https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/03/world/europe/greece-fire-helicopter-crash-firefighters.html",
      "description": "The aircraft crashed while battling a wildfire northwest of Athens, as Greece fought more than 200 fires in the past week.",
      "source_name": "NYT World News",
      "published": "2026-08-03T12:39:46"
